{
  "job_B8.5.4.1_20251003_114912": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t reaf, \u00fee se sylfa dryhten werede. Ac \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enra manna, \u00feonne he \u00e6rest on beseah, hym \u00feuhte, \u00fe\u00e6t hyt drihtnes andwlyta w\u00e6re. And Tiberius hyne sylfne geea\u00f0medde, and se hreofla, \u00fee hym \u00e6r lange on w\u00e6s, wear\u00f0 \u00fea sona ny\u00f0er And he sona gelyfde and wear\u00f0 gefullod and eall hys hyred and eall \u00fe\u00e6t folc, \u00fee hym underge\u00feeodd \u00deam sig wuldor and wur\u00f0mynt a in ealra worulda woruld, Amen..",
